        <footnote id="F1">Pursuant to the terms of the Executive Restricted Stock Unit Agreements governing the applicable awards, the Restricted Stock Units granted to the reporting person in October 2025 became fully vested upon the reporting person's attainment of Normal Retirement Age (as defined in such agreements). These shares represent shares withheld to cover the tax liability associated with the vesting of such Restricted Stock Units.</footnote>
